_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 27
---
order: 27
---
short_label: VI.27
---
statement: Of all the parallelograms applied to the same straight line falling short by parallelogrammic figures similar and similarly situated to that described on the half of the straight line, that parallelogram is greatest which is applied to the half of the straight line and is similar to the difference.
---
proof:

